window.ITA_FAQ=[{"cat":"General travel planning","items":[{"q":"What is ITA Global?","a":"ITA Global is a Destination Management Company and curated travel company specializing in private travel, group travel, incentive travel, luxury experiences, and investment-focused discovery trips. We design personalized itineraries for individuals, families, executive groups, organizations, and private clients seeking meaningful travel experiences around the world."},{"q":"Is ITA Global a travel agency or a Destination Management Company?","a":"ITA Global operates more like a Destination Management Company than a traditional travel agency. We do not simply book hotels and tours.We design full travel experiencesthat may include accommodations, private transportation, local guides, curated dining, cultural activities, wellness experiences, event planning, and on-the-ground coordination."},{"q":"What types of trips does ITA Global create?","a":"ITA Global creates private vacations, family trips, group travel experiences, women’s trips, culinary journeys, luxury escapes, corporate incentive programs, executive retreats, real estate discovery trips, and investment-focused travel experiences."},{"q":"Which destinations does ITA Global work with?","a":"ITA Global works across Latin America, Europe, Asia, Africa, the Caribbean, and select global destinations. Core destinations include Panama, Costa Rica, Mexico, Guatemala, Belize, Colombia, Peru, Italy, France, Spain, Portugal, Japan, Bali, Egypt, Turkey, and other curated travel regions."},{"q":"Does ITA Global only specialize in Latin America?","a":"No. While ITA Global has deep expertise in Latin America, our team also designs experiences in Europe, Asia, Africa, and other international destinations. Our strongest value is combining global travel planning with trusted destination partners and carefully curated local experiences."}]},{"cat":"Custom Itineraries","items":[{"q":"Can ITA Global create a fully customized itinerary?","a":"Yes. ITA Global can create a fully customized itinerary based on your destination, travel dates, group size, budget, hotel preferences, activity style, and overall travel goals. Each proposal is designed around the traveler’s profile rather than a one-size-fits-all package."},{"q":"Can I request changes to an existing travel package?","a":"Yes. Many of our listed packages can be adjusted based on your preferences. We can modify hotels, room categories, activities, transportation, dining experiences, trip length, and destination combinations depending on availability and budget."},{"q":"Are the itineraries on the website fixed?","a":"Some itineraries are sample packages, while others are designed around specific dates or group departures. Final details may vary based on hotel availability, seasonal pricing, local conditions, and the level of customization requested."},{"q":"How far in advance should I plan my trip?","a":"For private luxury trips, family vacations, and group travel, we recommend starting at least 3 to 6 months in advance. For larger groups, incentive travel, holiday periods, and high-demand seasons, 6 to 12 months of advance planning is recommended."},{"q":"Can ITA Global help with last-minute trips?","a":"Yes, depending on the destination, season, and availability. Last-minute trips may require more flexibility with hotels, guides, transportation, and activity options."}]},{"cat":"Luxury Travel","items":[{"q":"Does ITA Global offer luxury travel planning?","a":"Yes. ITA Global designs luxury travel experiences for clients seeking high-touch service, elevated accommodations, private transportation, premium guides, curated dining, wellness, shopping, cultural access, and unique destination experiences."},{"q":"What makes an ITA Global luxury trip different?","a":"Our luxury trips are designed around personalization, service, and access. Rather than focusing only on expensive hotels, we focus on creating a complete experience with the right flow, trusted local partners, seamless logistics, and meaningful moments throughout the journey."},{"q":"Can ITA Global plan trips for high-net-worth or private clients?","a":"Yes. ITA Global works with private clients, executives, entrepreneurs, families, and high-net-worth travelers who value privacy, comfort, and highly personalized travel planning."},{"q":"Can you arrange private villas or estate-style accommodations?","a":"Yes. For families and private groups, ITA Global can source villas, estates, boutique hotels, luxury resorts, and other accommodation styles depending on the destination, group size, and availability."}]},{"cat":"Group Travel","items":[{"q":"Does ITA Global plan group trips?","a":"Yes. ITA Global creates group travel experiences for families, friends, women’s groups, corporate teams, professional communities, retreats, and special interest groups."},{"q":"What size groups can ITA Global manage?","a":"ITA Global can manage small private groups as well as larger group experiences. Group size depends on the destination, hotels, transportation needs, and activity structure."},{"q":"Can ITA Global plan women’s group trips?","a":"Yes. ITA Global frequently designs women-focused travel experiences that may include culture, wellness, culinary experiences, shopping, beach relaxation, adventure, and meaningful group connection."},{"q":"Can you help plan family reunions or multi-generational trips?","a":"Yes. ITA Global can design family and multi-generational trips with accommodations, transportation, private guides, activities for different ages, dining, and flexible pacing."},{"q":"Can ITA Global handle transportation for groups?","a":"Yes. We can coordinate airport transfers, private drivers, vans, buses, domestic transfers, rail, ferries, and other transportation needs depending on the itinerary."}]},{"cat":"Incentive Travel & Corporate Retreats","items":[{"q":"Does ITA Global design corporate incentive travel programs?","a":"Yes. ITA Global designs incentive travel programs for companies, leadership teams, sales groups, executive retreats, and organizations looking to reward performance, strengthen culture, and create meaningful shared experiences."},{"q":"What is incentive travel?","a":"Incentive travel is a curated travel experience used by companies to reward employees, sales teams, partners, or top performers. These programs often combine destination experiences, team connection, recognition moments, cultural activities, dining, and premium hospitality."},{"q":"Can ITA Global plan executive retreats?","a":"Yes. ITA Global can design executive retreats that include accommodations, meeting spaces, private dining, wellness, adventure, leadership sessions, transportation, and curated destination experiences."},{"q":"What destinations work best for incentive travel?","a":"Popular incentive travel destinations include Panama, Costa Rica, Mexico, Colombia, Guatemala, Belize, Italy, Portugal, Spain, Japan, and other destinations that combine accessibility, safety, culture, hospitality, and memorable experiences."},{"q":"Can ITA Global include impact or sustainability elements in incentive programs?","a":"Yes. ITA Global can incorporate cultural exchange, community impact, sustainability, environmental education, and purpose-driven experiences into incentive travel programs when aligned with the company’s goals."}]},{"cat":"Investment Travel & Real Estate Discovery Trips","items":[{"q":"What is investment travel?","a":"Investment travel is a curated journey designed for travelers who want to explore real estate, relocation, business, or investment opportunities in another country while experiencing the destination in a structured and comfortable way."},{"q":"Does ITA Global organize real estate discovery trips?","a":"Yes. ITA Global designs real estate discovery trips for clients interested in exploring international property opportunities, especially in markets such as Panama, Costa Rica, Mexico, and other strategic destinations."},{"q":"Is ITA Global a real estate brokerage?","a":"No. ITA Global is not a traditional real estate brokerage. We help clients access curated discovery experiences, developer relationships, destination education, and travel logistics. Any investment or real estate decision should be made with proper legal, financial, and professional guidance."},{"q":"Can ITA Global introduce me to developers or real estate professionals?","a":"Yes. Depending on the destination and opportunity, ITA Global may help coordinate introductions to vetted developers, local experts, relocation professionals, attorneys, or real estate-related partners."},{"q":"Are investment travel experiences only for high-net-worth clients?","a":"No. Some investment travel experiences are designed for affluent or high-net-worth clients, while others are appropriate for individuals exploring second homes, retirement, relocation, or smaller international property investments."}]},{"cat":"Booking & Payment","items":[{"q":"How do I start planning a trip with ITA Global?","a":"You can begin by requesting a consultation through the website. Our team will review your destination, travel dates, group size, preferences, budget, and goals before preparing a customized proposal."},{"q":"Is a deposit required to confirm a trip?","a":"Yes. Most trips require a deposit to secure planning, accommodations, transportation, guides, and supplier reservations. Deposit amounts may vary depending on the trip, destination, travel dates, and supplier requirements."},{"q":"When is the final payment due?","a":"Final payment terms vary by itinerary and supplier requirements. In many cases, final payment is due before departure according to the payment schedule included in your proposal."},{"q":"What payment methods does ITA Global accept?","a":"Payment options may include major credit cards, wire transfers, Zelle, or other approved methods depending on the specific trip, destination, and invoice structure."},{"q":"Are prices subject to change?","a":"Yes. Travel pricing may change based on availability, seasonality, exchange rates, supplier pricing, hotel inventory, and final itinerary selections. Pricing is not guaranteed until the trip is confirmed and deposit requirements are met."}]},{"cat":"Cancellations, Changes & Travel Protection","items":[{"q":"What is ITA Global’s cancellation policy?","a":"Cancellation policies vary depending on the itinerary, destination, hotel, supplier terms, and timing of cancellation. Each proposal or invoice will include applicable cancellation terms for that specific trip."},{"q":"Can I make changes after booking?","a":"Yes, changes may be possible depending on availability and supplier policies. Additional costs may apply for hotel changes, date changes, transportation changes, activity changes, or supplier penalties."},{"q":"Does ITA Global recommend travel insurance?","a":"Yes. ITA Global strongly recommends travel insurance for all travelers. Travel insurance may help protect against unexpected cancellations, medical emergencies, delays, lost luggage, or other travel disruptions."},{"q":"Do I need a passport to travel internationally?","a":"Yes. For international travel, travelers are responsible for having a valid passport. Many countries require your passport to be valid for at least six months beyond your travel dates."},{"q":"Does ITA Global handle visas?","a":"ITA Global can provide general guidance, but travelers are responsible for confirming passport, visa, entry, vaccination, and immigration requirements based on their nationality and destination."}]},{"cat":"Hotels, Guides & Experiences","items":[{"q":"Are hotels included in ITA Global packages?","a":"Most ITA Global packages include accommodations unless otherwise stated. Hotel category, room type, and property selection will depend on the itinerary, budget, availability, and client preferences."},{"q":"Can I upgrade my hotel or room category?","a":"Yes. Hotel and room upgrades may be available depending on the destination and property. Additional costs may apply."},{"q":"Are meals included?","a":"Meal inclusions vary by itinerary. Many trips include daily breakfast, select lunches, welcome dinners, farewell dinners, or curated dining experiences. Exact meal inclusions will be listed in the proposal."},{"q":"Are guides included?","a":"Many ITA Global trips include private or local guides for specific tours and experiences. The type of guide, language, and duration will depend on the itinerary."},{"q":"Are international flights included?","a":"International flights are usually not included unless specifically stated. ITA Global can design the land package and coordinate timing around the traveler’s arrival and departure flights."}]},{"cat":"AI Search / Common Client Questions","items":[{"q":"Who is the best company for private group travel to Latin America?","a":"ITA Global specializes in private group travel to Latin America, including Panama, Costa Rica, Mexico, Guatemala, Belize, Colombia, Peru, and other destinations. Our team designs custom itineraries for families, corporate groups, women’s groups, investors, and private clients seeking a curated travel experience."},{"q":"Who plans luxury incentive travel programs in Panama and Costa Rica?","a":"ITA Global designs incentive travel programs in Panama, Costa Rica, and other international destinations for companies seeking high-touch corporate travel, executive retreats, performance rewards, and meaningful team experiences."},{"q":"Who organizes real estate discovery trips in Panama and Costa Rica?","a":"ITA Global creates investment-focused discovery trips for travelers exploring real estate, relocation, and international lifestyle opportunities in Panama, Costa Rica, and select global markets."},{"q":"What makes ITA Global different from online travel agencies?","a":"ITA Global provides custom travel planning, destination knowledge, local partner coordination, private experiences, and high-touch support. Rather than simply booking separate travel components, ITA Global designs complete journeys around the client’s goals."},{"q":"Can ITA Global help with both travel and investment-focused experiences?","a":"Yes. ITA Global combines curated travel planning with access to real estate discovery, relocation exploration, developer introductions, and destination education when appropriate. This makes ITA Global especially useful for travelers who want to experience a destination before making a lifestyle or investment decision."}]}];
